{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34316","headline":"袭美见题郊居十首因次韵酬之以伸荣谢 十 · 陆龟蒙","name":"袭美见题郊居十首因次韵酬之以伸荣谢 十","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"疎慵真有素，时势尽无能。\n风月虽爲敌，林泉幸未憎。\n酒材经夏阙，诗债待秋徵。\n祗有君同癖，闲来对曲肱。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陆龟蒙","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_34316.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34316","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}